OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFoggy and chilly to start but
OL,6,Fthe fog gradually clearing through the
OL,7,Fmorning. Staying bright but cloud
OL,8,Farriving through the day which will
OL,9,Fthen break for warm afternoon sunny
OL,10,Fspells, particularly for southern
OL,11,Fcoasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FLargely clear through the
OL,14,Fevening with light winds, allowing
OL,15,Ftemperatures to quickly fall for a
OL,16,Fchilly night. Fog starting to form
OL,17,Fbefore midnight, becoming extensive
OL,18,Finland by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
