OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FDense fog inland may be slow
OL,6,Fto clear through the morning, in some
OL,7,Fareas. Becoming more cloudy with spots
OL,8,Fof rain arriving in the afternoon.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FAn
OL,11,Funsettled start to Wednesday but rain
OL,12,Fgradually clears for sunny spells and
OL,13,Fa fresher, more autumnal feel. Long
OL,14,Fsunny spells through Thursday but
OL,15,Ffeeling cooler. Turning unsettled on
OL,16,FFriday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
